<title>CHILE: RTRS-Escondida January copper production rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Escondida January copper production rises.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's Minera Escondida Limitada reported the following copper and gold production figures for January:</p>
<p>    COPPER (metric tonnes)	Jan 97	Jan 96</p>
<p>    Copper in concentrates     62,907	47,024</p>
<p>    Copper cathodes		 5,501	 3,340</p>
<p>    Total			    68,408	50,364</p>
<p>					  Jan 97	Jan 96</p>
<p>    GOLD (ounces)		   12,138	14,162</p>
<p>NOTE: Minera Escondida is owned by The Broken Hill Proprietary Co Ltd and RTZ-CRA.</p>
</text>
